applies exclu) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 438.5 Td (       > sively to the Ruby/Resque worker process. It does **not** account for studen) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 428 Td (       > t processes executed inside Isolate boxes.) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 417.5 Td (  73 | * **Host Protection:** Student processes are constrained solely by Isolate's `--) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 407 Td (       > cg-mem` parameter \(default `256000 KB` = ~250 MB\). In staging, concurrency i) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 396.5 Td (       > s strictly locked to `COUNT=1`, ensuring that total sibling consumption cann) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 386 Td (       > ot exceed 250 MB. This fits easily within the ~2,100 MB unallocated host hea) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 375.5 Td (       > droom buffer \($8192\\text{ MB RAM} - 1100\\text{ MB OS} - 4992\\text{ MB stack ) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 365 Td (       > limits} = 2100\\text{ MB}$\).) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 354.5 Td (  74 | ) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 344 Td (  75 | ---) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 333.5 Td (  76 | ) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 323 Td (  77 | ## 4. Test Suite Execution & Evidence) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 312.5 Td (  78 | ) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 302 Td (  79 | Automated validation was executed across 5 test suites \(94 total tests\):) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 291.5 Td (  80 | ) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 281 Td (  81 | ```bash) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 270.5 Td (  82 | npm --prefix server run test -- \\) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 260 Td (  83 |   tests/phase51C5FinalVerification.test.js \\) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 249.5 Td (  84 |   tests/phase51C4BuildHardening.test.js \\) Tj ET BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 40 239 Td (  85 |   tests/phase5